sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant V as Vendor Browser
  participant VC as Vendor OrdersController
  participant OS as OrderService
  participant DB as SQL Server
  participant C as Customer Browser
  Note over DB: Order is already Paid (set by the webhook, Diagram 17)
  V->>VC: GET /Vendor/Orders
  VC->>OS: GetVendorOrderItemsAsync(currentVendorId)
  OS->>DB: SELECT OrderItems WHERE VendorProfileId = currentVendorId
  DB-->>VC: Only this vendor items
  V->>VC: POST MarkShipped(orderItemId)
  VC->>OS: UpdateFulfillmentAsync(orderItemId, Shipped, vendorId)
  OS->>DB: Load item WHERE Id = orderItemId AND VendorProfileId = vendorId
  alt item not found for this vendor
    OS-->>VC: NotFound (no data leak)
  else transition Pending to Shipped is allowed
    OS->>DB: FulfillmentStatus = Shipped
  end
  V->>VC: POST MarkDelivered(orderItemId)
  VC->>OS: UpdateFulfillmentAsync(orderItemId, Delivered, vendorId)
  OS->>DB: Update item, then if all active items Delivered set Order = Completed
  C->>OS: GET /Orders/Details/5 (own order only)
  OS-->>C: Items grouped by vendor with each FulfillmentStatus
